# N2e: e1m6's corridor at exact perspective (`r_perspspan 1`), turning from yaw 74.7 to
# 99.3 over the file, the rig's second pass.
#
# Assembly (N2e): a white box outlines one 32-pixel segment of row 450 on the right-hand
# wall (x 1238 to 1269 at yaw 100), the segment the edit's diagram plots, projected onto
# the frame at each frame's yaw.

map e1m6

duration 19.2
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset slop
hud off
cvar r_perspspan 1
cvar gamma 0.8

camera path
key 0     504,500,242  0,74.7209  ease linear
key 19.2  504,500,242  0,99.2791

sound on
events on
